{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16841","headline":"湖上闲居 · 窦参","name":"湖上闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"避影将息阴，自然知音稀。\n向来深林中，偶亦有所窥。\n飞鸟口衔食，引雏上高枝。\n高枝但各有，安知宜不宜。\n止止复何云，物情何自私。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}